 class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.03]\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><pattern id=\"grid\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#213261\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#grid)\"></rect></svg><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-primary rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[120px] opacity-[0.08] animate-blob\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-secondary rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[120px] opacity-[0.08] animate-blob animation-delay-2000\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-32 left-20 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-accent-dark rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[120px] opacity-[0.05] animate-blob animation-delay-4000\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-screen-2xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-14 max-w-2xl md:mb-16\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0, calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 24px), 0);\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl text-left \"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-2.5 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary\" style=\"transform: translate3d(calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * -26px), calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 14px), 0);\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary\" style=\"transform: translate3d(calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 8px), calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * -20px), 0);\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-pink\" style=\"transform: translate3d(calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 30px), calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 10px), 0);\"></span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl xs:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-[1.2] pb-2 text-dark\"><span class=\" inline-block leading-tight\"><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-text-item block\" style=\"animation-delay: 0ms; animation-play-state: running;\">Kompetencje,</span></span> <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-text-item block\" style=\"animation-delay: 50ms; animation-play-state: running;\">których</span></span> <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-text-item block\" style=\"animation-delay: 100ms; animation-play-state: running;\">potrzebujesz</span></span></span></h2><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 \">Nie jesteśmy agencją od wszystkiego. Specjalizujemy się w trzech kluczowych obszarach, które razem tworzą kompletny ekosystem wzrostu firmy.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-7\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0, calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 56px), 0);\"><a class=\"group relative flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl motion-safe:hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary\" href=\"/web-development/\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-white bg-primary/10 text-primary group-hover:bg-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xxs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400\">Strony &amp; Sklepy</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-dark\">Web Development</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">Twój biznes online musi być szybki i niezawodny. Budujemy dedykowane strony i sklepy, które nie tylko wyglądają, ale przede wszystkim sprzedają.</p><ul class=\"mb-8 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Systemy Dedykowane</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>E-commerce (WooCommerce)</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Optymalizacja Szybkości</li></ul><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-dark after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-2xl group-hover:gap-3\"><span>Zobacz Szczegóły</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0, calc((1 - var(--p, 1)) * 86px), 0);\"><a class=\"group relative flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl motion-safe:hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-secondary\" href=\"/marketing/\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-white bg-secondary/10 text-secondary group-hover:bg-secondary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-megaphone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 6a13 13 0 0 0 8.4-2.8A1 1 0 0 1 21 4v12a1 1 0 0 1-1.6.8A13 13 0 0 0 11 14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 14a12 12 0 0 0 2.4 7.2 2 2 0 0 0 3.2-2.4A8 8 0 0 1 10 14\"></path><path d=\"M8 6v8\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xxs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400\">Ads &amp; SEO</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-dark\">Marketing Cyfrowy</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600\">Przestań przepalać budżet. Wdrażamy kampanie performance, gdzie liczy się zwrot z inwestycji (ROAS), a nie puste zasięgi.</p><ul class=\"mb-8 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check shrink-0 text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Google Ads &amp; Meta Ads</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2